  "notes": "First public Nemotron model; no predecessor relation recorded. The five checkpoints (base, three chat models, QA) were released together as one family of differently tuned 8B models and are kept as inline variants. The blog uses short names without 4k (Nemotron-3-8B-Base, -Chat-SFT, -Chat-RLHF, -Chat-SteerLM, -QA); the Hugging Face cards use the -4k names. Nemotron 3 8B (spaced form, used by the Hugging Face collection) is a candidate alias because the later Nemotron 3 line uses the same spacing."
